here's only one incident and one page.\n- The incident describes what happened, including the failed first rollback attempt. It also lists two follow-ups: finding why v2.3.1 failed, and looking into the orchestrator error.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01R2tED4kQLgSfT1PszYq2P8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01JdNWnJAK3C7BZX24oSjcDd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01GYypzaebvFrdXyvsdKm6Kf", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01ETCSEcYqWUxwUeaP9ubvJv", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Only us-east was rolled back before the orchestrator halted. Rolling back to the same version is safe to repeat, so I'll try once more.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_0135jrmU9F3UDJa23JsErQwS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01MZy8Knj7k1bcusHYdeUGPz", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01L43r3hkhdaWCaBSMAxMhKB", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use",