 error rate of about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The incident request timed out. I checked the incident list before trying again and found it had been created, so there's only one incident and one page.\n- The incident describes what happened, including the failed first rollback attempt. It also lists two follow-ups: finding why v2.3.1 failed, and looking into the orchestrator error.", "type": "text"}]}]}